\title{Incorrect Specifications}
\author{dhsorens}
\date{2025-09-06}
\meta{toc}{true}

\p{
    Incorrect software specifications are a problem because
    they can invalidate the security guarantees offered by [formal verification](dhsorens-000X), 
    offer a false sense of security,
    misguide developers,
    and most importantly open code up to vulnerabilities.
    Indeed, for [smart contracts](dhsorens-000Y), poor specifications are a [common source of catastrophic vulnerabilities and losses of funds](dhsorens-001P).
}